<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 26/27.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 26/27.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania  set on</p>
<p>the following currency fixings for Friday, June 27 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   27.06.97	  26.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.6640	    6.6612</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3192	    2.3269</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5462	    4.5582</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5162	    3.5205</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5219	    0.5197</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7771	    0.7764</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2899	    0.2909</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0243	    7.0256</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6938	    0.6937</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2337	    1.2371</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
